stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Prepared
  Prepared --> Queued: current approval and authority
  Queued --> Sent: durable attempt checkpoint
  Sent --> Accepted: verified business receipt
  Sent --> Rejected: definitive business rejection
  Sent --> Uncertain: response unavailable
  Uncertain --> Accepted: lookup proves acceptance
  Uncertain --> Queued: proven absent and policy still valid
  Uncertain --> Review: outcome remains unknown
  Rejected --> Prepared: reviewed correction
  Accepted --> [*]
